From: Peter Lemenkov <lemenkov@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jun 2016 15:15:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Use NL value in COMMENT declaration

Signed-off-by: Peter Lemenkov <lemenkov@gmail.com>

diff --git a/src/mimetypes_scan.xrl b/src/mimetypes_scan.xrl
index c562a5a..357b9c9 100644
--- a/src/mimetypes_scan.xrl
+++ b/src/mimetypes_scan.xrl
@@ -1,9 +1,9 @@
 Definitions.
 
-WS     = ([\s\t])
-NL     = (\r?[\n])
+WS     = ([\s\t])+
+NL     = (\r?[\n])+
 
-COMMENT = (#.*\n)
+COMMENT = (#.*{NL})
 STR = ([a-zA-Z_/\-0-9\+\.]+)
 
 Rules.
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ Rules.
 {NL}  : {token, {'newline', TokenLine}}.
  
 {COMMENT} : skip_token.
-{WS}+  : skip_token.
+{WS} : skip_token.
 
 
 Erlang code.
